{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Wu Hun Dalu","The scientist Chu Feng accidentally obtained the “Jin Wuling” that turned into a meteorite and fell. In order to explore its origin, Chu Feng created a supercomputer “Qiyuan”. With Qiyuan's help, Chu Feng learned that Jin Wuling actually came from a place called Wuhun. The mysterious world of the continent Chu Feng also inadvertently inspired Jin Wuling's power to be transported to Wuhun Continent. In the \"Wuhun Continent\", Chu Feng rescued Su Manqing, the third young lady of the Su family, but thus became enmity with the Nangong and Lu clans.\n\n(Source: Bangumi, translated)"],"ja":["武魂大陆",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-62659","ids":{"shikimori":62659,"mal":62659,"anilist":199417,"kodik":"serial-70418"},"kodikIds":["serial-70071","serial-70418"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-70071":"2026-03-01T11:59:04Z","serial-70418":"2025-10-05T00:24:44Z"},"title":"Континент боевых духов","originalTitle":"Wu Hun Da Lu","alt":"Континент боевых душ / Wu Hun Dalu / Martial Soul Continent 武魂大陆","description":"The scientist Chu Feng accidentally obtained the “Jin Wuling” that turned into a meteorite and fell. In order to explore its origin, Chu Feng created a supercomputer “Qiyuan”. With Qiyuan's help, Chu Feng learned that Jin Wuling actually came from a place called Wuhun. The mysterious world of the continent Chu Feng also inadvertently inspired Jin Wuling's power to be transported to Wuhun Continent. In the \"Wuhun Continent\", Chu Feng rescued Su Manqing, the third young lady of the Su family, but thus became enmity with the Nangong and Lu clans. (Source: Bangumi, translated)","year":2025,"type":"ONA","genres":["Экшен","Фэнтези","Фантастика","боевые искусства"],"rating":null,"popularity":84,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/62659/f260217d689e9628bae7c1e72a7f5cbe.jpeg","width":750,"height":1000},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.